      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Upper_Black_Eddy,_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Because it sits in a floodplain, Upper Black Eddy has more than 200 homes in the 100‑year flood zone, a fact managed under the National Flood Insurance Program.",
